he communities you build here. Version 10 and newer version are not compatible in multiplayer mode with older versions.", "short_description": "Learning The Maths is a social platform focused on the teaching and learning of mathematics.  The multiplayer rooms are intended to encourage tutoring and mentoring in math and applied math.  The included games and teaching modules are meant to take interested students beyond the basics. Version 10 and newer are not compatible in multiplayer mode with older versions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://orcavirtual.com/LTMPrivacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Orca Virtual", "support_website_url": "https://orcavirtual.com/", "website_url": "https://orcavirtual.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25064559316498985"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974750_800764658829840_2421879972465347623_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I1fpJmmz_F8Q7kNvwHNgN5Z&_nc_oc=AdlRSRUTx3Ykj5aZPTn2LG2x4Y9le0PXKvhAqqHYPPuAIDJK4Nf8zhpKlTbpgIlrAvM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzSjXF5U6ZkOt72Z71V8MJFsoNvkjoakdAHMVHPTGL_tA&oe=69B177B2"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_vali